# Healthcare Data Analytics System

A data analytics and machine learning project that analyzes healthcare datasets and predicts disease risk using machine learning techniques.

## Features
- Healthcare data analysis using Python
- Correlation analysis of medical attributes
- Visualization using heatmaps and charts
- Disease risk prediction using Random Forest Machine Learning model

## Technologies Used
Python  
Pandas  
Matplotlib  
Seaborn  
Scikit-learn

## Dataset Attributes
- Age
- BMI
- Blood Pressure
- Glucose
- Insulin
- Outcome (Disease Risk)

## Machine Learning Model
Random Forest Classifier used to predict disease risk based on healthcare indicators.

## Project Structure
dataset.csv → healthcare dataset  
analysis.py → data analysis and visualization  
model.py → machine learning prediction model

## Purpose
This project demonstrates the use of data analytics, machine learning, and information systems in healthcare data analysis.